# Backend Rules

- Keep privileged Supabase operations server-side.
- Never expose Supabase service-role credentials to client code.
- Put database access in `src/services`.
- Validate input before persistence.
- Enforce authorization server-side.
- Treat database constraints and RLS as part of the security boundary.
- Keep external integrations behind service boundaries.
